{"articleNo":"201402","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=201402&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대구통학버스] 2018년 동계방학(계절학기 포함) 대구통학버스 운행 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.12.06","hit":"5402","attachments":[{"name":"운행계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=201402&attachNo=78698"},{"name":"동계방학(계절포함) 승차위치.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=201402&attachNo=79298"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2018학년도 동계방학(계절학기 포함) 대구통학버스를 다음과 같이 운행할 예정이오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 예약시작일 :<strong><span style=\"COLOR: #ef007c\"> 2018</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ef007c\">.12.18.(화)부터~</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 운행대상 : 발전기금 기부 예우자(대구통학버스 이용 선택)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. ​운행기간 및 운행대수</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2018.12.24.(월)~2019.01.22.(화) :&nbsp;4대 운행</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -​ 2019.01.23.(수)~2019.02.28.(목) :&nbsp; 1대 운행</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 탑승방법 : 예약시스템 적용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 운행노선 : [붙임] 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #3a32c3\">* 대수 및 노선은 조정될 수 있음 </span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기타 문의사항은 학생처(478-7040)으로 연락바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">​</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -13pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">​</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
